Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `load` is a value, not a named function
  --> tests/ui/E0112_live_closure_source.jet:5:25
    |
  5 |     binding :: app.live(load, 1)
    |                         ^^^^
 Why: A live binding re-runs its source by name, and the source's module path names it on the wire; a closure has no such name
 Fix: Declare the source as a top-level `fn` and pass its name
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
